    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
This class inherits from :cpp:class:`BaseSLR1Parser`

The context-free parser used for a subset of the string representation of a `sympy logic
query`_

eg.

.. code-block:: ini
    :linenos:

    ~(($y$ | Ne($x$, $y$)) &amp; (($x$ &gt;= $y$) | ($x$ &lt;= $y$)) &amp; Eq($x$, $y$*$z$ - $y$ + $z$/3))
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
